# PM disperse (always)

On multi-file, multi-area, Unraid/Compose, wave, or “team” user tasks:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/agent-pm/SKILL.md` + `agent-team/SKILL.md`.
2. **Do not** implement product code / Compose / SPA / runbooks as the parent — **Task** `@agent-ops`, `@agent-backend`, `@agent-uiux`, `@agent-desktop`, `@agent-qa`, `@agent-docs`, `@agent-gamemaster` as owners (use agent-team **intent → seat router**).
3. **Relevant agent only** — never assign or do another seat’s product work in-parent; seats must refuse wrong-seat Tasks and hand off.
4. Process/skill edits are OK when the user asks to improve the team.
5. After implementer Tasks land, Task **docs** to refresh `docs/strategy/progress.md` and the program canvas at  
   `C:\Users\cephyrix_zyth\.cursor\projects\c-Users-cephyrix-zyth-Desktop-gametheca\canvases\gametheca-program.canvas.tsx`  
   (sections: TLDR · Done · Next · Blocked · Team flow). Refuse close without **Canvas: synced**.
